  <p class="intro">I'm a Lead Engineer at Thoughtworks, with a background in journalism and a career building web products.</p>
  <p>I work across product engineering, architecture and technical leadership: building software, guiding technical decisions and helping teams deliver and evolve their products.</p>
  <p>My work has also taken me into technical publishing, as a Technical Product Owner for the Thoughtworks Technology Radar and Looking Glass. Engineering and journalism have more in common than you might think: asking good questions, making sense of complexity and explaining things clearly.</p>
  <p>Based in São José dos Campos, Brazil. Working with teams around the world.</p>
